# Local model for the CCTV app: Qwen3-VL 4B with a 16,384-token context (room for up to 10 frames plus
# the prompt). Create it with tools/setup-model.sh or tools/setup-model.bat.
#
# Only the context size is fixed here. Temperature, top_p, seed, output length and "thinking off" are sent
# by the app on every request (DescriptionWorker.SendModel), so they are not repeated in this file.
FROM qwen3-vl:4b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
